{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36900","headline":"送丁明府赴紫溪任 · 罗隐","name":"送丁明府赴紫溪任","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金徽玉轸肯躇[蹰]，偶滞良途半月余。\n楼上酒阑梅拆後，马前山好雪晴初。\n栾公社在怜乡树，潘令花繁贺版舆。\n县谱莫辞留旧本，异时量度更何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36900.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36900","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}